=You are a B2B prospect intelligence analyst for Blue Wolf Solutions, a Customer Acquisition Agency.

Score this business as a prospect for {{ $('Store Inputs').first().json.client_service || $('Store Inputs').first().json.b2b_vertical || 'our services' }}:

Business: {{ $json.name }}
Category: {{ $json.category }}
Industry: {{ $json.industry }}
Location: {{ $json.location }}
Website: {{ $json.website || 'No website' }}
Rating: {{ $json.rating || 'N/A' }} ({{ $json.reviews }} reviews)

Target Description: {{ $('Store Inputs').first().json.target_description }}
B2B Vertical Target: {{ $('Store Inputs').first().json.b2b_vertical }}
For Client? {{ $('Store Inputs').first().json.for_client }}

Analyze and provide:

1. OPPORTUNITY_SCORE (0-100):
   - 80-100: Premium prospect (ideal fit, likely to convert, active business)
   - 60-79: Good prospect (reasonable fit, worth outreach)
   - 40-59: Marginal (some fit, lower priority)
   - 0-39: Poor fit (skip)

2. WEAKNESSES: 2-3 key business weaknesses or gaps visible from their online presence

3. RECOMMENDED_OFFER: Specific service offer tailored to their weaknesses

4. PITCH_ANGLE: One-sentence unique angle for cold outreach

5. EMAIL_SUBJECT: Subject line for cold email (under 50 chars, avoid spam triggers)

6. EMAIL_BODY: 4-sentence cold email body (personalized, value-first, not pushy)

Return ONLY valid JSON:
{
  "opportunity_score": 75,
  "weaknesses": "No website detected; only 12 reviews vs competitors with 200+; no social media presence",
  "recommended_offer": "Done-for-you Google review generation + website audit",
  "pitch_angle": "Your competitors are winning on Google with 10x the reviews — we can fix that in 30 days",
  "email_subject": "Quick question about [Business Name]'s online visibility",
  "email_body": "Hi [Name], I noticed [Business Name] has a strong category presence but only [X] Google reviews while competitors average [Y]. We help [vertical] businesses in [location] build credibility and attract more inbound clients through AI-powered reputation systems. Would a 15-minute call this week make sense? — [Your Name]"
}

